Paiva | Psi High Level</div>\n      <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(340px,1fr)); gap:64px; align-items:center\">\n        <div>\n          <x-import component-from-global-scope=\"JLiaPaivaDesignSystem_6db484.Pill\" tone=\"dark\" hint-size=\"auto,30px\">Masterclass ao vivo \u00b7 14 de setembro</x-import>\n          <h1 style=\"font-family:'Bethany Elingston',Georgia,serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(38px,4.2vw,64px); line-height:1.06; letter-spacing:-0.015em; margin:24px 0 22px; text-wrap:balance\">\n            Psi, faltam <span style=\"color:#D3FB04\">menos de 4 meses</span> pra 2026 acabar. Seu consult\u00f3rio vai fechar o ano do jeito que voc\u00ea prometeu em janeiro ou do mesmo jeito de sempre?\n          </h1>\n          <p style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.6; color:rgba(246,246,246,.75); max-width:620px; margin:0 0 30px; text-wrap:pretty\">\n            Nessa aula voc\u00ea aprende os 3 pilares que mudam o seu resultado, de forma mais r\u00e1pida nos \u00faltimos meses do ano, sustentado por posicionamento claro e um plano at\u00e9 dezembro, com pacientes novos e sem sufoco.\n          </p>\n          <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px; margin-bottom:34px; max-width:560px\">\n            <div style=\"display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:baseline; border-top:1px solid rgba(246,246,246,.16); padding-top:12px\">\n              <span style=\"font-family:'Nimbus Sans Cond',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(246,246,246,.5); width:120px; flex-shrink:0\">Data</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:17px; color:#F6F6F6\">14 de setembro de 2026, \u00e0s 19h</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:baseline; border-top:1px solid rgba(246,246,246,.16); padding-top:12px\">\n              <span style=\"font-family:'Nimbus Sans Cond',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(246,246,246,.5); width:120px; flex-shrink:0\">Formato</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:17px; color:#F6F6F6\">100% ao vivo, pelo Zoom</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:baseline; border-top:1px solid rgba(246,246,246,.16); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(246,246,246,.16); padding:12px 0\">\n              <span style=\"font-family:'Nimbus Sans Cond',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(246,246,246,.5); width:120px; flex-shrink:0\">Investimento</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:17px; color:#F6F6F6\">R$ 27 (menos que um mc donalds)</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <x-import component-from-global-scope=\"JLiaPaivaDesignSystem_6db484.Button\" on-click=\"{{ irParaCheckout }}\" hint-size=\"auto,56px\">Garantir minha vaga por R$ 27</x-import>\n        </div>\n        <div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section data-screen-label=\"Identifica\u00e7\u00e3o\" style=\"padding:clamp(56px,8vw,88px) clamp(20px,5vw,72px)\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"text-align:center\">\n        <x-import component-from-global-scope=\"JLiaPaivaDesignSystem_6db484.Pill\" hint-size=\"auto,30px\">Se identifica?</x-import>\n        <h2 style=\"font-family:'Bethany Elingston',Georgia,serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(34px,4.4vw,52px); line-height:1.1; margin:20px 0 16px\">J\u00e1 s\u00e3o mais de 8 meses de 2026</h2>\n        <p style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.9; max-width:640px; margin:0 auto\"><span style=\"background:#D3FB04; color:#191919; font-weight:700; padding:3px 8px; box-decoration-break:clone; -webkit-box-decoration-break:clone\">E o seu consult\u00f3rio continua exatamente como estava em janeiro, ou voc\u00ea est\u00e1 come\u00e7ando agora, perdida.</span></p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr)); gap:16px; margin-top:44px\">\n        <x-import component-from-global-scope=\"JLiaPaivaDesignSystem_6db484.Card\" hint-size=\"100%,180px\">\n          <div style=\"font-family:'Bethany Elingston',Georgia,serif; font-size:23px; line-height:1.25; margin-bottom:10px\">Voc\u00ea posta, se dedica, tenta</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; color:rgba(25,25,25,.72)\">E n\u00e3o v\u00ea o resultado que esperava chegar.</div>\n        </x-import>\n        <x-import component-from-global-scope=\"JLiaPaivaDesignSystem_6db484.Card\" hint-size=\"100%,180px\">\n          <div style=\"font-family:'Bethany Elingston',Georgia,serif; font-size:23px; line-height:1.25; margin-bottom:10px\">Depende de indica\u00e7\u00e3o</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; color:rgba(25,25,25,.72)\">Cobra menos do que devia e v\u00ea o ano passando.</div>\n        </x-import>\n        <x-import component-from-global-scope=\"JLiaPaivaDesignSystem_6db484.Card\" hint-size=\"100%,180px\">\n          <div style=\"font-family:'Bethany Elingston',Georgia,serif; font-size:23px; line-height:1.25; margin-bottom:10px\">A mesma pergunta voltando</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; color:rgba(25,25,25,.72)\">\u201cSer\u00e1 que 2027 tamb\u00e9m vai terminar assim?\u201d</div>\n        </x-import>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"max-width:640px; margin:40px auto 0; text-align:center; font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#191919; text-wrap:pretty\">\n        Voc\u00ea estudou anos pra isso. Se dedicou. Faz um trabalho excelente. Mas o ano est\u00e1 acabando e o consult\u00f3rio continua igual.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section data-screen-label=\"Valida\u00e7\u00e3o\" style=\"padding:0 clamp(20px,5vw,72px) clamp(56px,8vw,88px)\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:900px; margin:0 auto\">\n      <x-import component-from-global-scope=\"JLiaPaivaDesignSystem_6db484.Card\" padding=\"{{ 48 }}\" hint-size=\"100%,260px\">\n        <div style=\"text-align:center\">\n          <h2 style=\"font-family:'Bethany Elingston',Georgia,serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(30px,3.8vw,44px); line-height:1.1; margin:0 0 18px\">Sabe como eu sei disso?</h2>\n          <p style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.9; color:rgba(25,25,25,.72); max-width:640px; margin:0 auto 14px\">\n            Eu sei porque eu j\u00e1 passei por isso. <span style=\"background:#D3FB04; color:#191919; font-weight:700; padding:3px 8px; box-decoration-break:clone; -webkit-box-decoration-break:clone\">Cobrava R$ 80 por sess\u00e3o, postava sem estrat\u00e9gia e achava que o problema era o algoritmo.</span> At\u00e9 entender que faltava m\u00e9todo, n\u00e3o vontade.\n          </p>\n          <p style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.6; color:#191919; max-width:640px; margin:0 auto\">\n            Voc\u00ea \u00e9 excelente no que faz. S\u00f3 ainda n\u00e3o aprendeu a fazer isso virar agenda cheia, ainda.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </x-import>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section data-screen-label=\"Oportunidade\" style=\"background:#191919; color:#F6F6F6; padding:clamp(56px,8vw,88px) clamp(20px,5vw,72px)\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto\">\n      <x-import component-from-global-scope=\"JLiaPaivaDesignSystem_6db484.SectionHeader\" tone=\"dark\" eyebrow=\"Os dados que provam\" title=\"A demanda nunca foi t\u00e3o grande\" support=\"O Brasil fechou 2025 com mais de 546 mil afastamentos por sa\u00fade mental, recorde batido pela segunda vez em 10 anos. \u00c9 a nossa oportunidade aqui no digital de captar essas pessoas.\" hint-size=\"100%,200px\"></x-import>\n      <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr)); gap:16px; margin-top:48px\">\n        <div style=\"background:#262626; border-radius:14px; padding:28px 22px\">\n          <div style=\"font-family:'Bethany Elingston',Georgia,serif; font-size:clamp(38px,4vw,52px); line-height:1; color:#D3FB04\">546 mil+</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:15px; line-height:1.5; color:rgba(246,246,246,.7); margin-top:10px\">afastamentos por sa\u00fade mental em 2025, recorde hist\u00f3rico</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background:#262626; border-radius:14px; padding:28px 22px\">\n          <div style=\"font-family:'Bethany Elingston',Georgia,serif; font-size:clamp(38px,4vw,52px); line-height:1; color:#F6F6F6\">+15%</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:15px; line-height:1.5; color:rgba(246,246,246,.7); margin-top:10px\">de crescimento sobre 2024</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background:#262626; border-radius:14px; padding:28px 22px\">\n          <div style=\"font-family:'Bethany Elingston',Georgia,serif; font-size:clamp(38px,4vw,52px); line-height:1; color:#F6F6F6\">2\u00ba lugar</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:15px; line-height:1.5; color:rgba(246,246,246,.7); margin-top:10px\">ansiedade e depress\u00e3o juntas s\u00e3o o segundo maior motivo de afastamento do trabalho no Brasil</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background:#262626; border-radius:14px; padding:28px 22px\">\n          <div style=\"font-family:'Bethany Elingston',Georgia,serif; font-size:clamp(38px,4vw,52px); line-height:1; color:#F6F6F6\">NR\u20111</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:15px; line-height:1.5; color:rgba(246,246,246,.7); margin-top:10px\">desde maio de 2026 j\u00e1 permite multar empresas que n\u00e3o cuidam da sa\u00fade mental de quem trabalha nelas</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:24px; margin-top:26px; flex-wrap:wrap\">\n        <div style=\"font-family:'Nimbus Sans Cond',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(246,246,246,.5)\">Fonte: INSS / ANAMT / MTE, 2025 e 2026</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:19px; color:#F6F6F6\">O que falta \u00e9 voc\u00ea ser encontrada no digital.</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section data-screen-label=\"Solu\u00e7\u00e3o\" style=\"padding:clamp(56px,8vw,88px) clamp(20px,5vw,72px)\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"text-align:center\">\n        <x-import component-from-global-scope=\"JLiaPaivaDesignSystem_6db484.Pill\" hint-size=\"auto,30px\">A solu\u00e7\u00e3o</x-import>\n        <h2 style=\"font-family:'Bethany Elingston',Georgia,serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(34px,4.4vw,52px); line-height:1.1; margin:20px 0 16px\">Os 3 pilares que mudam o seu resultado mais r\u00e1pido</h2>\n        <p style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.9; max-width:660px; margin:0 auto\"><span style=\"background:#D3FB04; color:#191919; font-weight:700; padding:3px 8px; box-decoration-break:clone; -webkit-box-decoration-break:clone\">Na Masterclass Psi High Level eu vou te mostrar o que muda seu resultado mais r\u00e1pido nos \u00faltimos meses do ano: conte\u00fado estrat\u00e9gico, posicionamento e planejamento.</span></p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr)); gap:16px; margin-top:44px\">\n        <x-import component-from-global-scope=\"JLiaPaivaDesignSystem_6db484.Card\" hint-size=\"100%,200px\">\n          <div style=\"font-family:'Nimbus Sans Cond',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(25,25,25,.5)\">Pilar 01</div>\n          <div style=\"font-family:'Bethany Elingston',Georgia,serif; font-size:28px; line-height:1.2; margin:10px 0 10px\">Conte\u00fado estrat\u00e9gico</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; color:rgba(25,25,25,.72)\">O que muda o resultado mais r\u00e1pido nos \u00faltimos meses do ano.</div>\n        </x-import>\n        <x-import component-from-global-scope=\"JLiaPaivaDesignSystem_6db484.Card\" hint-size=\"100%,200px\">\n          <div style=\"font-family:'Nimbus Sans Cond',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(25,25,25,.5)\">Pilar 02</div>\n          <div style=\"font-family:'Bethany Elingston',Georgia,serif; font-size:28px; line-height:1.2; margin:10px 0 10px\">Posicionamento claro</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; color:rgba(25,25,25,.72)\">Pra esse conte\u00fado encontrar exatamente quem precisa dele.</div>\n        </x-import>\n        <x-import component-from-global-scope=\"JLiaPaivaDesignSystem_6db484.Card\" hint-size=\"100%,200px\">\n          <div style=\"font-family:'Nimbus Sans Cond',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(25,25,25,.5)\">Pilar 03</div>\n          <div style=\"font-family:'Bethany Elingston',Georgia,serif; font-size:28px; line-height:1.2; margin:10px 0 10px\">Plano at\u00e9 dezembro</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; color:rgba(25,25,25,.72)\">Pra voc\u00ea n\u00e3o parar no meio do caminho de novo.</div>\n        </x-import>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"max-width:640px; margin:40px auto 0; text-align:center; font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; text-wrap:pretty\">\n        N\u00e3o estamos falando de uma aula rasa e nem de motiva\u00e7\u00e3o. Vou te entregar uma <strong style=\"font-weight:700\">estrutura aplic\u00e1vel que ainda d\u00e1 tempo de mudar o fechamento do seu 2026, captando os seus pacientes no digital.</strong>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section data-screen-label=\"Prova social\" style=\"padding:0 clamp(20px,5vw,72px) clamp(56px,8vw,88px)\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr)); gap:clamp(28px,4vw,56px); align-items:center\">\n        <div>\n          <x-import component-from-global-scope=\"JLiaPaivaDesignSystem_6db484.Pill\" hint-size=\"auto,30px\">Elas dizem...</x-import>\n          <h2 style=\"font-family:'Bethany Elingston',Georgia,serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(34px,4.4vw,52px); line-height:1.1; margin:20px 0 16px\">O m\u00e9todo que mudou mais de 1000 psic\u00f3logas at\u00e9 agora</h2>\n          <p style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.6; color:rgba(25,25,25,.62); margin:0; max-width:520px\">Isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 sorte, \u00e9 m\u00e9todo. Atualmente nossa comunidade tem 550 alunas ativas vivendo essa transforma\u00e7\u00e3o comigo.</p>\n        </div>\n        <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/psijuliapaiva-star/jp-masterclass-assets/main/assets/img-alunas-premiadas.jpg\" alt=\"Alunas premiadas no PHL Day\" style=\"display:block; width:100%; max-width:330px; height:auto; border-radius:18px; margin-left:auto\">\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:48px\">\n        <div style=\"column-count:3; column-gap:16px\">\n          <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/psijuliapaiva-star/jp-masterclass-assets/main/assets/img-depoimento-1.jpg\" alt=\"Depoimento de aluna\" style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:14px; margin-bottom:16px; break-inside:avoid\">\n          <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/psijuliapaiva-star/jp-masterclass-assets/main/assets/img-depoimento-2.jpg\" alt=\"Depoimento de aluna\" style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:14px; margin-bottom:16px; break-inside:avoid\">\n          <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/psijuliapaiva-star/jp-masterclass-assets/main/assets/img-depoimento-3.jpg\" alt=\"Depoimento de aluna\" style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:14px; margin-bottom:16px; break-inside:avoid\">\n          <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/psijuliapaiva-star/jp-masterclass-assets/main/assets/img-depoimento-4.jpg\" alt=\"Depoimento de aluna\" style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:14px; margin-bottom:16px; break-inside:avoid\">\n          <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/psijuliapaiva-star/jp-masterclass-assets/main/assets/img-depoimento-5.jpg\" alt=\"Depoimento de aluna\" style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:14px; margin-bottom:16px; break-inside:avoid\">\n          <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/psijuliapaiva-star/jp-masterclass-assets/main/assets/img-depoimento-6.jpg\" alt=\"Depoimento de aluna\" style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:14px; margin-bottom:16px; break-inside:avoid\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section data-screen-label=\"Polariza\u00e7\u00e3o\" style=\"background:#191919; color:#F6F6F6; padding:clamp(56px,8vw,88px) clamp(20px,5vw,72px)\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto\">\n      <x-import component-from-global-scope=\"JLiaPaivaDesignSystem_6db484.SectionHeader\" tone=\"dark\" eyebrow=\"Dois caminhos\" title=\"Dezembro de 2026. Dois cen\u00e1rios poss\u00edveis.\" support=\"Faltam poucos meses. De qual lado voc\u00ea quer estar?\" hint-size=\"100%,200px\"></x-import>\n      <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr)); gap:20px; margin-top:48px\">\n        <div style=\"background:#262626; border-radius:18px; padding:34px\">\n          <div style=\"font-family:'Nimbus Sans Cond',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(246,246,246,.5)\">Cen\u00e1rio 1</div>\n          <div style=\"font-family:'Bethany Elingston',Georgia,serif; font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,32px); line-height:1.2; margin:12px 0 14px; color:rgba(246,246,246,.85)\">A psic\u00f3loga que deixou pra depois, de novo</div>\n          <p style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.6; color:rgba(246,246,246,.7); margin:0\">Terminou o ano igual come\u00e7ou. Mesma agenda inst\u00e1vel. Mesma depend\u00eancia de indica\u00e7\u00e3o. Fazendo a mesma promessa de sempre: \u201c2027 vai ser diferente.\u201d Spoiler: n\u00e3o vai.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background:#191919; border:2px solid #D3FB04; border-radius:18px; padding:34px\">\n          <div style=\"font-family:'Nimbus Sans Cond',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#D3FB04\">Cen\u00e1rio 2</div>\n          <div style=\"font-family:'Bethany Elingston',Georgia,serif; font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,32px); line-height:1.2; margin:12px 0 14px; color:#F6F6F6\">A psic\u00f3loga que decidiu nos \u00faltimos meses</div>\n          <p style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.6; color:rgba(246,246,246,.75); margin:0\">Fechou 2026 com agenda cheia, lista de espera, cobrando o que vale. Usou os \u00faltimos meses do ano pra reverter o que os primeiros oito n\u00e3o deram conta.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section data-screen-label=\"Oferta\" style=\"padding:clamp(56px,8vw,88px) clamp(20px,5vw,72px)\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto\">\n      <x-import component-from-global-scope=\"JLiaPaivaDesignSystem_6db484.SectionHeader\" eyebrow=\"A oferta\" title=\"Masterclass Psi High Level\" support=\"14 de setembro de 2026, \u00e0s 19h, 100% ao vivo.\" hint-size=\"100%,180px\"></x-import>\n      <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr)); gap:20px; margin-top:44px; align-items:start\">\n        <x-import component-from-global-scope=\"JLiaPaivaDesignSystem_6db484.Card\" padding=\"{{ 40 }}\" hint-size=\"100%,420px\">\n          <div style=\"font-family:'Nimbus Sans Cond',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(25,25,25,.5); margin-bottom:22px\">O que voc\u00ea vai aprender</div>\n          <x-import component-from-global-scope=\"JLiaPaivaDesignSystem_6db484.CheckList\" items=\"{{ aprendizados }}\" hint-size=\"100%,300px\"></x-import>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:26px; padding-top:22px; border-top:1px solid rgba(25,25,25,.14)\">\n            <div style=\"font-family:'Nimbus Sans Cond',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(25,25,25,.5); margin-bottom:10px\">E ainda...</div>\n            <p style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.9; margin:0\"><span style=\"background:#D3FB04; color:#191919; font-weight:700; padding:3px 8px; box-decoration-break:clone; -webkit-box-decoration-break:clone\">E voc\u00ea vai ganhar um calend\u00e1rio de conte\u00fados e um Notion de planejamento para colocar tudo em pr\u00e1tica, al\u00e9m de outros mimos surpresas.</span></p>\n          </div>\n        </x-import>\n        <x-import component-from-global-scope=\"JLiaPaivaDesignSystem_6db484.PriceCard\" eyebrow=\"Investimento\" price=\"R$ 27\" subline=\"Menos que um mc donalds\" cta-label=\"Garantir minha vaga\" on-click=\"{{ irParaCheckout }}\" microcopy=\"Vaga confirmada na hora, link do Zoom por e-mail.\" hint-size=\"100%,280px\"></x-import>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section data-screen-label=\"Urg\u00eancia\" style=\"background:#191919; color:#F6F6F6; padding:clamp(56px,8vw,88px) clamp(20px,5vw,72px); text-align:center\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:820px; margin:0 auto\">\n      <x-import component-from-global-scope=\"JLiaPaivaDesignSystem_6db484.Pill\" tone=\"dark\" hint-size=\"auto,30px\">\u00daltimos meses de 2026</x-import>\n      <h2 style=\"font-family:'Bethany Elingston',Georgia,serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(34px,4.4vw,52px); line-height:1.1; margin:22px 0 18px; text-wrap:pretty\">N\u00e3o d\u00e1 pra esperar <span style=\"color:#D3FB04\">janeiro</span> de novo</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.6; color:rgba(246,246,246,.75); margin:0 auto 12px; max-width:640px\">\n        As psic\u00f3logas que se posicionarem agora v\u00e3o capturar essa demanda ainda em 2026. As que esperarem v\u00e3o fechar o ano exatamente como come\u00e7aram.\n      </p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#F6F6F6; margin:0 auto 32px; max-width:640px\">\n        A diferen\u00e7a n\u00e3o \u00e9 talento e nem sorte. \u00c9 decis\u00e3o, e o tempo de decidir \u00e9 agora.\n      </p>\n      <x-import component-from-global-scope=\"JLiaPaivaDesignSystem_6db484.Button\" on-click=\"{{ irParaCheckout }}\" hint-size=\"auto,56px\">Eu decido agora, R$ 27</x-import>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section data-screen-label=\"Bio\" style=\"padding:clamp(56px,8vw,88px) clamp(20px,5vw,72px)\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1000px; margin:0 auto; display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr)); gap:clamp(28px,4vw,48px); align-items:center\">\n      <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/psijuliapaiva-star/jp-masterclass-assets/main/assets/img-julia-bio.jpg\" alt=\"J\u00falia Paiva\" style=\"display:block; width:100%; aspect-ratio:4/5; object-fit:cover; object-position:center 28%; border-radius:18px\">\n      <div>\n        <x-import component-from-global-scope=\"JLiaPaivaDesignSystem_6db484.Pill\" hint-size=\"auto,30px\">Quem te ensina</x-import>\n        <h2 style=\"font-family:'Bethany Elingston',Georgia,serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,46px); line-height:1.1; margin:20px 0 18px\">J\u00falia Paiva</h2>\n        <p style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.6; color:rgba(25,25,25,.72); margin:0 0 14px\">Psic\u00f3loga e mentora de psic\u00f3logas que querem viver de consult\u00f3rio particular. Criei o M\u00e9todo Psi High Level depois de sair de uma agenda vazia cobrando R$ 80 por sess\u00e3o para uma agenda fechada com lista de espera.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.6; color:rgba(25,25,25,.72); margin:0 0 14px\">Hoje mais de 1000 alunas j\u00e1 passaram, ou est\u00e3o passando, pelo mesmo caminho comigo, sem perder a \u00e9tica e sem parecer marqueteira.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.6; color:#191919; margin:0\">Se eu consegui virar o jogo mesmo com o ano quase acabando, voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m consegue.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section data-screen-label=\"FAQ\" style=\"padding:0 clamp(20px,5vw,72px) clamp(60px,8vw,96px)\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:860px; margin:0 auto\">\n      <x-import component-from-global-scope=\"JLiaPaivaDesignSystem_6db484.SectionHeader\" eyebrow=\"Perguntas frequentes\" title=\"Ainda na d\u00favida?\" hint-size=\"100%,140px\"></x-import>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; margin-top:36px\">\n        <sc-for list=\"{{ faq }}\" as=\"item\" hint-placeholder-count=\"6\">\n          <x-import component-from-global-scope=\"JLiaPaivaDesignSystem_6db484.Module\" index=\"{{ item.index }}\" title=\"{{ item.title }}\" description=\"{{ item.description }}\" hint-size=\"100%,64px\"></x-import>\n        </sc-for>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"text-align:center; margin-top:44px\">\n        <x-import component-from-global-scope=\"JLiaPaivaDesignSystem_6db484.Button\" on-click=\"{{ irParaCheckout }}\" hint-size=\"auto,56px\">Garantir minha vaga por R$ 27</x-import>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer style=\"background:#191919; color:rgba(246,246,246,.5); padding:40px clamp(20px,5vw,72px); text-align:center\">\n    <div style=\"font-family:'Bethany Elingston',Georgia,serif; font-size:22px; color:#F6F6F6; margin-bottom:10px\">J\u00falia Paiva</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:14px\">Masterclass Psi High Level \u00b7 14 de setembro de 2026, 19h \u00b7 100% ao vivo</div>\n  </footer>\n\n</div>\n</x-dc>\n<script type=\"text/x-dc\" data-dc-script=\"\">\nclass Component extends DCLogic {\n  renderVals() {\n    return {\n      irParaCheckout: () => window.open('https://pay.hub.la/yeb66V7cjFiyxzbC1PE7', '_blank', 'noopener'),\n      aprendizados: [\n        { ok: true, text: 'Os pilares que mudam o seu resultado de forma mais r\u00e1pida nos \u00faltimos meses de 2026: conte\u00fado estrat\u00e9gico, posicionamento e planejamento.' },\n        { ok: true, text: 'Como captar e converter pacientes.' },\n        { ok: true, text: 'Como cobrar o valor justo pela sess\u00e3o e atingir 5 d\u00edgitos por m\u00eas com previsibilidade.' },\n        { ok: true, text: 'Como fazer o reajuste de sess\u00e3o para 2027.' },\n        { ok: true, text: 'Como se posicionar para atrair quem j\u00e1 est\u00e1 buscando ajuda.' },\n        { ok: true, text: 'Como planejar os \u00faltimos meses do ano sem sofrer.' },\n        { ok: true, text: 'Como aproveitar a maior onda de demanda por sa\u00fade mental da hist\u00f3ria.' },\n      ],\n      faq: [\n        { index: '01', title: 'A masterclass \u00e9 ao vivo?', description: 'Sim, 100% ao vivo no dia 14 de setembro \u00e0s 19h.' },\n        { index: '02', title: 'Faltam poucos meses pro fim do ano, ainda vale a pena?', description: 'Justamente por isso. Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisa dos 12 meses do ano pra mudar o resultado, precisa aplicar certo nos que restam, e eles valem para 2027 inteiro.' },\n        { index: '03', title: 'Sou rec\u00e9m-formada. Isso serve pra mim?', description: 'Serve especialmente pra voc\u00ea. Quanto antes aprender a se posicionar, antes constr\u00f3i a carreira do jeito certo.' },\n        { index: '04', title: 'J\u00e1 tenho consult\u00f3rio h\u00e1 anos. Isso ainda serve pra mim?', description: 'Se sua agenda n\u00e3o est\u00e1 cheia do jeito que voc\u00ea gostaria, sim. Tempo de forma\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o garante agenda cheia, estrat\u00e9gia garante.' },\n        { index: '05', title: 'Marketing n\u00e3o \u00e9 anti\u00e9tico pra psic\u00f3loga?', description: 'Posicionamento \u00e9 \u00e9tica, n\u00e3o marketing sujo. O CFP permite divulga\u00e7\u00e3o, desde que feita com responsabilidade. \u00c9 exatamente isso que eu ensino.' },\n        { index: '06', title: 'Por que R$ 27?', description: 'Porque eu quero que o investimento n\u00e3o seja barreira, nem desculpa. Por menos do que um mc donalds, voc\u00ea aprende o que falta pra fechar 2026 diferente.' },\n      ],\n    };\n  }\n}\n</script>\n\n\n</body></html>"